// Pure module: constants + serializers for the admin-check checklist (T-A).
// No I/O, no side effects. Imported by viewer/scripts/build-map-artifacts.mjs,
// viewer/src/AdminChecklist*.jsx and tests/ui/admin_checklist.test.mjs so the
// generated bytes and the in-browser export come from one implementation.
//
// This module produces no judgement. It never derives passability, safety or
// accessibility, never fills UNKNOWN, and never converts a status word into a
// four-state verdict.

